{"id":"n24536-1-7","stage":3,"title":"붓다 · 肿","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24536-1-7-1","ko":"왜 이렇게 눈이 부었어?","zh":"为什么眼睛会这么肿啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"눈이","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈이","audio":"/audio/6f2474549eb981a98228.mp3"}},{"text":"부었어?","meaning":"肿","explanation":"붓다：肿；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"붓다","audio":"/audio/76139f25aacdfbc108a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24536","senseId":"1","lemma":"붓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부었어","audio":"/audio/1e28cb37d44f203b5c24.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"76139f25aacdfbc1","term":"붓다","zh":"肿","audio":"/audio/76139f25aacdfbc108a1.mp3","entryId":"24536","definition":"某个部位的肌肤鼓起凸出。","pronunciation":["붇ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b824315f4234c7951263.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24536-1-7-2","ko":"어젯밤에 슬픈 영화를 보고 울었더니 눈이 부어 버렸어.","zh":"昨晚看了部悲伤的电影还哭了，结果眼睛就肿起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어젯밤에","meaning":"昨夜","explanation":"어젯밤：昨夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어젯밤","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67078","senseId":"1","lemma":"어젯밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어젯밤에","audio":"/audio/993b356a7580926fa1bc.mp3"}},{"text":"슬픈","meaning":"悲伤的，伤心的","explanation":"슬프다：悲伤的，伤心的；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"슬프다","audio":"/audio/710c55f6dfa550624362.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65103","senseId":"1","lemma":"슬프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"슬픈","audio":"/audio/33fe9425bb5623365934.mp3"}},{"text":"영화를","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화를","audio":"/audio/dede45f73452f5a077ee.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"울었더니","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"울었더니","audio":"/audio/de765cdd1cd77b66c1c5.mp3"}},{"text":"눈이","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈이","audio":"/audio/6f2474549eb981a98228.mp3"}},{"text":"부어","meaning":"肿","explanation":"붓다：肿；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"붓다","audio":"/audio/76139f25aacdfbc108a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24536","senseId":"1","lemma":"붓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부어","audio":"/audio/3d2bf7798f969d6b66cd.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸어.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸어","audio":"/audio/fe1d7a5ead4341d8e790.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"faa5384e37664674","term":"어젯밤","zh":"昨夜","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3","entryId":"67078","definition":"昨天的夜晚。","pronunciation":["어제빰","어젣빰"]},{"id":"710c55f6dfa55062","term":"슬프다","zh":"悲伤的，伤心的","audio":"/audio/710c55f6dfa550624362.mp3","entryId":"65103","definition":"心里痛苦难受得落泪。","pronunciation":["슬프다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"76139f25aacdfbc1","term":"붓다","zh":"肿","audio":"/audio/76139f25aacdfbc108a1.mp3","entryId":"24536","definition":"某个部位的肌肤鼓起凸出。","pronunciation":["붇ː따"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/59e28ce728d3d730dcea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24536","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":101,"sequenceScore":2.6567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["昨晚看了部悲伤的电影还哭了，结果眼睛就肿起来了。","车子的前面有点凹陷了呢？","为什么眼睛会这么肿啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨晚看了部悲伤的电影还哭了，结果眼睛就肿起来了。","为什么眼睛会这么肿啊？","车子的前面有点凹陷了呢？"],"answer":0}]}
